{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792768500, "covers_from": "2026-10-23T15:15:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-23T15:16:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792768560, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:15:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 47139, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "到處都有人在吸菸，說好的無菸城市是發生什麼事？", "display_name": "中山代表 No.47,139", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:15:08+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 57769, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "您好，我是居住在台北市松山區、民權公園地下停車場「正對面」的在地居民。此停車場是東榮里居民賴以維生的", "display_name": "松山代表 家家媽", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:15:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56888, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你當選市長，勞工退休金（純舊制）會不會依據勞基法辦理！\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.56,888", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T15:15:37+00:00", "duration_seconds": 23, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 40913, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "取消台北橋往台北方向公車專用道，尖峰時間在橋上塞30分鐘，很多公車甚至也不走專用道，跟普通汽車搶道!", "display_name": "大同代表 No.40,913", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 57769, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 家家媽", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 56888, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.56,888", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 40913, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.40,913", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 36101, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "大安代